                        "sense_id": "701e8e07-cb2c-3e6f-bf7d-6db78908c94a",
                        "entry_id": "d94e0296-9733-3e92-816f-6db0c0ce8c1a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A voodoo practitioner who deals with malefic as well as beneficial effects; a sorcerer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2782ab1b-fb78-4068-a69d-fdbd7bacee94",
                                "sense_id": "701e8e07-cb2c-3e6f-bf7d-6db78908c94a",
                                "text": "A bòkò is an entrepreneur, and has a reputation as a man who will “work with both hands,” that is, for healing and revenge."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28f191b1-579e-4655-bd8f-e8b9c7fd3f3a",
                                "sense_id": "701e8e07-cb2c-3e6f-bf7d-6db78908c94a",
                                "text": "“The bokor who knows the magic can make anyone a zombi—a Haitian living abroad, a foreigner.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdfeb585-aaac-4a40-befa-4615c1ad3560",
                                "sense_id": "701e8e07-cb2c-3e6f-bf7d-6db78908c94a",
                                "text": "The corpse is buried in all solemnity, and two days later, at dead of night, the bocor digs it up, stops feeding it salt, and has himself a zombie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c21d22b-ae3b-48fb-9199-1892cf23e581",
                                "sense_id": "701e8e07-cb2c-3e6f-bf7d-6db78908c94a",
                                "text": "It seemed to him that he was […] surrendering all agency and becoming hers to command, as if she were a Haitian bokor and he at lunch at Bergdorf Goodman had been administered the so-called zombie's cucumber which confused his thought processes and made him her slave for life."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
